Exactly 4 people in frame: Jalen, Theo, Nova, Priya.

[LOOK]
Photoreal live-action comedy commercial, 16:9. Brooklyn walk-up living room exactly as @Image1 and @Image2: exposed brick, black sash windows with fire escape, worn oak floor, patterned red-and-navy rug, oatmeal boucle sofa with mustard, rose, black-and-white checkered and red kilim cushions and a cream knit throw, chunky reclaimed-oak coffee table, brown leather armchair, round rust-velvet floor cushion, plants, string lights, framed posters. BLUE HOUR, about 7:30 pm, the same in every shot: deep cobalt dusk and the lit Manhattan skyline through the windows, warm 2700K table lamps, string lights and a candle inside, warm-and-cool contrast. Fine natural grain, soft halation on practicals, real skin texture. The friends play a silly fight over one fry with total action-movie seriousness, and nobody speaks.

[BLOCKING]
Fixed for the whole film: Jalen sits on the LEFT end of the oatmeal boucle sofa; Nova sits on the RIGHT end of the sofa; Theo sits cross-legged on the round rust-velvet floor cushion on the near side of the coffee table, facing the sofa; Priya sits apart in the brown leather armchair in the front-left corner by the windows. The plain white fry box starts in the centre of the coffee table. The green front door is at the back right, down the short hallway.

[TIMELINE]
Five shots with hard cuts, one continuous story.
0-3 s: close top-down three-quarter view of the plain white fry box (@Image7) alone in the centre of the oak coffee table with ONE straight-cut fry inside; Jalen's ringed right hand slides in from frame left and hovers above it without touching.
3-6 s: static wide master from the window corner. Theo, on the floor cushion opposite, grips Jalen's wrist across the table an inch before the fry; they lock eyes, deadly serious. Nova watches from the right end of the sofa; Priya sits calmly in the armchair.
6-8 s: table-level medium shot: Nova quietly slides the box toward herself; both men snap their heads to her and glare; she freezes, caught.
8-12 s: quick handheld action cuts: Jalen throws the checkered cushion, Theo blocks it with the mustard cushion; Nova dives along the sofa and lands short of the box; Jalen's and Theo's hands race for the box and stop in a standoff. The box stays upright, the fry untouched.
12-15 s: over-the-shoulder close shot of Priya in the armchair: her phone shows the Bolly Eats 'Your basket' screen (@Image8); she taps the yellow Place order button and it changes to 'Order confirmed' (@Image9); a small satisfied smile while the fight blurs behind her.

[CAMERA]
Cuts at 3, 6, 8 and 12 s. Every angle is taken from the window side of the room; the wide shot matches the room reference framing.

[AUDIO]
Room tone, a grab sound, a paper scrape, cushion thumps and effort breaths, one soft phone tap and chime. Sound design only, no music, no voices.

NEGATIVE: no dialogue, no talking, no lip movement as speech; no music; no on-screen text, captions, subtitles, chat bubbles, title cards or UI overlays; no split screen, no collage, no multi-panel layout, never show the reference sheets themselves; no extra people, no duplicate characters, nobody else enters; no jackets, coats, bags or sunglasses on the cast; no daylight, no sunset sun, no golden-hour sunlight; no McDonald's or any other real fast-food brand, no golden arches, no logos except the lowercase 'bolly eats.' marks exactly as referenced; the original fry box stays plain and unbranded; faces, skin tones, hair colours and outfits never change from the references.
